<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates fall.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates fall.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight and one-week rates on the Egyptian pound fell in the interbank private sector on Thursday, when the market is traditionally very liquid.</p>
<p>Overnight rates were 10 percent against Wednesday's 10 3/8 and 10 7/16 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>One-week rates fell to 10 percent from 10 7/16 percent.</p>
<p>Public sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
